    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>liquid used for washing out</i>, esp. <i>clyster,
			drench</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.77
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24
			</span></i> tit. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>surf</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτραι παραθηγόμεναι τῷ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nav.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>place washed by the waves, sea-beach</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of a
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίναιδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.126
			</span></i>; of a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.39
			</span></i>.</div>
